<DocsPageTitle Path="Components/PropertyGrid" AddedVersion="2.3" AddedDate="2026-07-30">
    Blazorise PropertyGrid component
</DocsPageTitle>

<DocsPageLead>
    Review and edit related values in a compact inspector.
</DocsPageLead>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Overview
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    Use a property grid for object inspectors, settings panels, and designer surfaces where users need to adjust many related values without a large form.
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    Each property is displayed as a label and editor row, with related properties organized into collapsible groups.
    Properties can be searched or arranged by category or name, while optional row actions and descriptions provide additional behavior and guidance without crowding the editor.
</DocsPageParagraph>

<DocsPageSectionTitle>
    Structure
</DocsPageSectionTitle>

<DocsPageParagraph>
    Compose a <Code>PropertyGrid</Code> from a toolbar, groups of property rows, and an optional help panel. Use <Code>PropertyGridView</Code> to generate these parts from a <Code>PropertyGridSchema</Code> instead.
</DocsPageParagraph>

